OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed for 'several hours' as
OL,4,Alorry overturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road will be closed for "several
OL,7,Fhours" after a lorry overturned into a
OL,8,Fditch.
OL,10,FSuffolk Police said it received a call
OL,11,Fat 0600 BST on Wednesday about a single
OL,12,Fvehicle collision on the A143 at
OL,13,FStanton, Suffolk.
OL,15,FThe fire service was called and
OL,16,FHighways informed about damage to the
OL,17,Froad surface. No injuries were
OL,18,Freported.
