OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed for 'several hours' as
OL,4,Alorry overturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the road was closed in
OL,7,Fboth directions to recover a lorry that
OL,8,Foverturned earlier this morning. The
OL,9,Froad is expected to be closed for
OL,10,Fseveral hours.
